[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-advance-c3 5...c5"]
[Name "Advance: 5.c3 c5 6.Bb5+"]

6. Bb5+ Nc6 { Blocks and develops. The pin is no worry: the bishop is simply offered the knight. }
7. O-O a6 { Asks the bishop to decide. If it takes on c6, Black gets the b-file and keeps the bishop pair. } *
